    "_comment": "Generate a free AWS Canary Token at https://canarytokens.org and paste its credentials here, then save this file as canary_tokens.json (which is gitignored). When an attacker steals the bait and uses it, canarytokens.org alerts you instantly. These are decoy credentials by design — they grant no access — but keep your own token out of git so nobody can burn it.",
